{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And you shall build.</b> The builders who come forth from you." "<b>The foundations of generation upon generation.</b> Which were on a foundation that would stand for generation upon generation." "<b>You shall raise up.</b> Like תשובב (Psalms 60:3) — 'you shall restore paths to rest' — after people no longer walk on them, 'to rest you shall restore them.'"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 58, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:10.691681169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}